26:["$","p","release-2",{"children":[["$","$1c","text-0",{"children":"The ethical questions are therefore twofold. What could release make possible for this individual, and what avoidable risks could arise if it were attempted without adequate preparation? The desire to reduce human control should be accompanied by responsibility for the foreseeable consequences of doing so."}]]}]
